(- Cell capacity: C_cell = 4.2 Ah) Tj
T*
(- Cell internal AC resistance \(1 kHz\): R_cell = 10.0 milliOhms) Tj
T*
(- Maximum continuous discharge rating: 45 A per cell) Tj
T*
(- Competition Rules Constraints: Maximum allowed tractive system voltage = 400.0 V DC;) Tj
T*
(Max power limit = 80.0 kW.) Tj
T*
(\(a\) Determine the cell series-parallel configuration \(Ns-Np\) to achieve 400 V peak) Tj
T*
(voltage and deliver 80 kW.) Tj
T*
(\(b\) Calculate the total internal resistance of the battery pack and total internal I^2*R) Tj
T*
(heat dissipation at 80 kW power draw.) Tj
T*
(\(c\) Determine the cooling airflow rate \(CFM\) required to prevent cell temperatures from) Tj
T*
(exceeding 50 deg C ambient during an endurance heat run.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Step-by-Step Solution:) Tj
T*
(1. Series and Parallel Cell Configuration:) Tj
T*
(- Maximum pack voltage at 100% state of charge: V_pack_max = N_s * 4.20 V <= 400.0 V.) Tj
T*
(- N_s = floor\(400.0 / 4.20\) = floor\(95.23\) = 95 cells in series.) Tj
T*
(- Nominal pack voltage: V_pack_nom = 95 * 3.60 V = 342.0 V.) Tj
T*
(- Maximum current drawn at 80 kW power limit \(at nominal voltage\):) Tj
T*
(I_pack_max = P_limit / V_pack_nom = 80,000 W / 342.0 V = 233.92 A.) Tj
T*
(- Parallel cell requirement: N_p = ceil\(I_pack_max / I_cell_max\) = ceil\(233.92 / 45\) =) Tj
T*
(ceil\(5.20\) = 6 cells in parallel.) Tj
T*
(- Accumulator Architecture: 95S6P configuration.) Tj
T*
(- Total number of cells: N_total = 95 * 6 = 570 cells.) Tj
T*
(- Total Pack Energy Capacity: E_pack = 95 * 3.60 V * \(6 * 4.2 Ah\) = 342 V * 25.2 Ah =) Tj
T*
(8,618.4 Wh = 8.62 kWh.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Pack Internal Resistance and Thermal Heat Generation:) Tj
T*
(- Resistance of one string of 95 series cells: R_string = 95 * 10.0 milliOhms = 950) Tj
T*
(milliOhms = 0.95 Ohms.) Tj
T*
(- Total pack internal resistance \(6 strings in parallel\): R_pack = R_string / 6 = 0.95 /) Tj
T*
(6 = 0.1583 Ohms \(158.3 milliOhms\).) Tj
T*
(- Internal I^2*R heat dissipation at peak 233.92 A load:) Tj
T*
(Q_heat = I_pack_max^2 * R_pack = \(233.92\)^2 * 0.1583 = 54,718.5 * 0.1583 = 8,662 W =) Tj
T*
(8.66 kW of thermal energy!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Thermal Management and Cooling Airflow Calculation:) Tj
T*
(- Permissible air temperature rise: Delta_T = T_max_cell - T_ambient = 50 deg C - 35 deg) Tj
T*
(C = 15 deg C \(15 K\).) Tj
T*
(- Specific heat capacity of air: c_p = 1,005 J / \(kg * K\); Air density: rho = 1.184) Tj
T*
(kg/m^3.) Tj
T*
(- Required mass flow rate of cooling air: m_dot = Q_heat / \(c_p * Delta_T\)) Tj
T*
(m_dot = 8,662 / \(1,005 * 15\) = 8,662 / 15,075 = 0.5746 kg/s.) Tj
T*
(- Volumetric flow rate: V_dot = m_dot / rho = 0.5746 / 1.184 = 0.4853 m^3/s.) Tj
T*
(- Convert to CFM \(Cubic Feet per Minute, 1 m^3/s = 2,118.88 CFM\):) Tj
T*
(Airflow = 0.4853 * 2,118.88 = 1,028.3 CFM.) Tj
T*
(- Engineering Selection: Install two 12V high-static-pressure brushless blowers rated at) Tj
T*
